at this dinner."},{"t":"fut","p":6,"neg":true,"lat":"ma ghadish tsekhkhnu l-ma l-yum","ar":"ما غاديش تسخنو الما اليوم","en":"You (pl.) will not heat the water today."},{"t":"fut","p":7,"lat":"ghadi ysekhkhnu d-dar qbel l-lil","ar":"غادي يسخنو الدار قبل الليل","en":"They will warm the house before night."},{"t":"fut","p":7,"neg":true,"lat":"ma ghadish ysekhkhnu had l-biru","ar":"ما غاديش يسخنو هاد البيرو","en":"They will not heat this office."}]
